9. Cyberattack Disrupts Operations of Japanese Frozen Food Giant Nichirei (securityweek) —
   checked against yesterday's featured.jsonl entry "Cyberattack on Japan's Largest Cold-Chain
   Operator Disrupts KFC, Supermarket Supplies" (2026-07-16, rank 5). Both are almost certainly
   the same underlying Nichirei incident, but src.featured classify returned "different" —
